+\textbf{Multi-embedder.} Re-running the grounding battery on three unrelated encoders (Qwen3-0.6B, $1024$-d; MPNet, $768$-d \citep{song_mpnet_2020}; and MiniLM, $384$-d \citep{wang_minilm_2020}), grounding holds throughout (top-1 $67\%$, $70\%$, $57\%$; all far above chance), and the three encoders assign the same symbol to a probe $73\%$ of the time. Accuracy tracks encoder capacity (the smallest model, MiniLM, is weakest, as expected), but the readout reflects the symbolic system and the probe semantics rather than any single model's geometry. \textbf{Independent probes and label-free checks.} The thirty-probe battery was written alongside the method. On 199 probes written independently by a language model in four styles (scenes, qualities, story fragments, and cues, none naming a symbol), agreement with the intended symbol is lower (top-1 $37\%$ for $\Delta$ and $44\%$ for plain similarity, chance $10\%$), a reminder that single-target agreement is at most a sanity check for a field built to remain open. Three checks that need no intended symbol speak more directly to the uses above. A reading is stable under rewording, since paraphrases keep the symbol profile of their source (mean Spearman $\rho=0.84$, against $0.24$ between different sentences) and can be matched back to their source among 38 from the profile alone in $48\%$ of cases (chance $3\%$). It is only weakly sensitive to swapping a single element of a scene, which moves the profile somewhat more than rewording does (AUC $0.68$) and raises the edited-in symbol in $56\%$ of cases. And one node absorbs many readings, Thunder being the strongest symbol for $52\%$ of 466 symbol-related sentences and Bag for $30\%$ of 200 everyday ones. We treat these as properties of the model's pull on the field that a practitioner should see (\S\ref{sec:discussion}) rather than as scores to optimise.
+
+These checks answer the ``signal vs.\ noise'' and ``one-model artifact'' objections. They show that the recouplings are structured and stable across encoders. Whether they are meaningful readings of the tradition itself is for community-grounded review to establish (\S\ref{sec:discussion}).
